  "releaseNotes": "- [ThunderPropagator#28] Use async disposal for memory streams in connection handlers\\n- [ThunderPropagator#28] [Major] ManualResetEvent.WaitOne() in ConnectAsync blocks async thread — ThreadPool starvation risk   src/ThunderPropagator.Application/Channels/AbstractChannel.MessagesHandler.cs   - Replaced ManualResetEvent manualResetEvent = new(true) with TaskCompletionSource gateSource   - Replaced manualResetEvent.WaitOne() with await gateSource.Task.WaitAsync(cancellationToken)   - Renamed ApplyThreadPause → ApplyGate; the new ApplyGate calls TrySetResult() to open and uses Interlocked.CompareExchange to safely swap in a new incomplete TCS to close, guarding against the   race where a close+open sequence would orphan a pending await",
